### What the instrument actually does

| measurement | fit | residual quality | blunt reading |
|---|---|---|---|
| **M1** dI₀ | `−ε₁ · 2√(I₀I₁) sin(−Δφ)` | **R² = 1.000**, RMSE 1.6×10⁻⁸ | only bilinear hop; θ and detune do not enter instantaneous power |
| **M2** \|dI\| vs detune | flat: CV = **0** | exact | “complete cycle” is **not** implemented — leakage is always on |
